# marketing-kb-grounded-reasoning is written for the gate-proxied OK MCP
# channel (search/exec/links) and is served to that channel's testers
# through the gate's own `skills` tool -- it stays on disk for that. It
# must NOT be pushed to GitHub: a Claude-based tester on the read-only
# GitHub mirror channel (search/read only, no exec/links) auto-discovers
# .claude/skills/ on its own and would follow this skill's instructions
# instead of AGENTS.md, which is the correct, already-adapted instruction
# file for that channel. See project-context/remote-mcp-access.md.
